00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:21.808
you never get back

00:07:21.808 --> 00:07:23.676
on the same path again.

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:27.046
But but you're on a different course

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.449
where the decisions we make

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:31.050
in the coming years

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.252
will determine the course of our world

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.921
for decades to come.

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:36.989
It happens every five or six generations.

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:38.057
But we're at that point

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:40.126
Nothing gives me greater

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:41.561
confidence in the future

00:07:41.561 --> 00:07:43.396
than knowing Connect Canada

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:44.831
and the United States

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:48.067
stand together still today.

